Write costly recurring lessons and concluded decisions under /notes/. One fact per note; description states its conclusion with key conditions, not its topic. Update description when the conclusion changes. Keep current-state memory concise; changes belong in commit messages and decision records. Do not duplicate facts maintained in the repository. Never store credentials. Session memory and history lookup are not available.",
